<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Layout-Aware Parsing Meets Efficient LLMs: A Unified, Scalable Framework for Resume Information Extraction and Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion and Future Work</span></a></li>
